      ],
      "source": "https://www.rio.com/practical-rio/lagoa",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A 7.5‑kilometre cycleway circles the lagoon, inviting joggers, cyclists, and families for leisurely strolls.",
